<p>A <code>ganttTableTR</code> is one part of a
  <a href="/components/gantt-table/"><code>ganttTable</code></a>.
  It maps to the native HTML <code>&lt;tr&gt;</code>
  element. See the <a href="/components/gantt-table/">Gantt Table
  demo</a> for composed examples.</p>

{# BEGIN generated: examples (bin/generate-examples) #}
<h2>Usage</h2>
<pre tabindex="0"><code>{% raw %}&lt;GanttTableBody&gt;
  &lt;GanttTableTr&gt;
    &lt;GanttTableTH scope="row"&gt;Design phase&lt;/GanttTableTH&gt;
    &lt;GanttTableTD active&gt;████&lt;/GanttTableTD&gt;
    &lt;GanttTableTD active&gt;████&lt;/GanttTableTD&gt;
    &lt;GanttTableTD&gt;&lt;/GanttTableTD&gt;
  &lt;/GanttTableTr&gt;
  &lt;GanttTableTr&gt;
    &lt;GanttTableTH scope="row"&gt;Development&lt;/GanttTableTH&gt;
    &lt;GanttTableTD&gt;&lt;/GanttTableTD&gt;
    &lt;GanttTableTD active&gt;████&lt;/GanttTableTD&gt;
    &lt;GanttTableTD active&gt;████&lt;/GanttTableTD&gt;
  &lt;/GanttTableTr&gt;
&lt;/GanttTableBody&gt;
{% endraw %}</code></pre>
